    {
      "id": "ff1adaf7-f013-4d4e-bdf3-640cd83ac96d",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "To continue this task, write statements in the next code cell that test the following assertions.\n\n* The student has less than 12 transfer credits.\n* The student is studying away this semester.\n* The total number of credits the student has is less than 88.",
