    {
      "id": "f204682b-3bbf-4c54-91e8-dc8e080760a6",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "#### Adding more rules task\n\nMany students don't think that when they get to register depends on only the total number of credits. Some might want to assign points differently for the different kinds of credits; others might want to consider additional factors, like athletics or clubs or the student's major.\n\nAt the bottom of this description cell, you should first write **three** (or more) additional rules that you want to use in determining how many registration points a student gets. These rules are in addition to the existing rules; they do not replace them. \n\nHere are the additional guidelines.\n\n* Your new rules should be written in ways that can be easily translated into code. Example: *If the student studies away, they are assigned an additional 5 points.*\n* The rules must consider at least two new factors, like GPA or whether the student is an athlete. Not all your new rules need to use the new factors. \n* At least one of your new rules should use a logical expression, something that would require the `&&` or `||` logical operators. Example: *If the student has 88 or more total credits **and** fewer than 12 transfer credits, they are assigned an additional 3 points.*\n\nYou **should not** use any of these examples exactly as written, but you may modify them in some way that you can justify to others.\n\n**Add your new rules here**\n\nRule 1: \n\nRule 2: \n\nRule 3:\n\n*Add more rules if you've defined them*",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "markdown",
        "id": "f204682b-3bbf-4c54-91e8-dc8e080760a6"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9e6bca43-5153-4522-a3c4-dd2ae30eedef",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "#### Defining factors task\n\nThe previous task required that you add at least two new factors. For each factor, give the Java type and identifier you will use when you add these rules to your code.\n\nFactor 1:\n\nType:\n\nIdentifier: \n\nFactor 2:\n\nType:\n\nIdentifier:\n\n*Add more factors if you've defined them*",
      "metadata": {
