        "id": "9e6bca43-5153-4522-a3c4-dd2ae30eedef"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c6ae7e41-43db-45b7-922c-962a10f3a988",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "#### Implementing your new rules task\n\nModify the `calculatePoints()` method to add conditional statements that implement your new rules. The code that's already present should not change.",
