    {
      "id": "8dade7ac-ec4d-4384-93db-d87dde2ba6ef",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "#### Testing your new rules task\n\nIn the initial setup task, you declared variables for a student and assigned them values. \n\nReturn to that cell and declare the variables for the new factors using the type and identifier you stated and assigning them a value you choose.\n\nThen, run all the cells from the beginning to see that there are no errors and that you get a new value for the assigned number of registration points. \n\nIf there are errors, review the instructions and code from the past few tasks to be sure that they're done correctly. And ask questions if you're not sure.",
      "metadata": {
