      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "#### Trying out some new students task\n\nIn the next *three* code cells, we're going to build three new students and test our method. Don't declare any variables; just assign new values to all existing variables, such as \n\n```java\nguilfordCredits = 47;\ntransferCredits = 0;\n```\n\nand so on so that each of the original variables *and* the variables you added for your factors have new values. \n\nThen, use the `calculatePoints()` method to display the registration points for that student.",
      "metadata": {
